==Battleground==
*10 [[Those Guys]] spawn after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>, delay 10~13.33 seconds<sup>300f~400f</sup>.
*3 [[Owlbrow]]s spawn after 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>, delay 1 second<sup>30f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Teacher Bun Bun]] spawns as the boss.
**30 [[Those Guys]] spawn, delay 3.33~6.67 seconds<sup>100f~200f</sup>.
**Infinite [[Sinner Snache]]s spawn, delay 20~26.67 seconds<sup>600f~800f</sup>.
**10 [[Sinner Snache]]s spawn, delay 6.67~10 seconds<sup>200f~300f</sup>.
**10 [[Sinner Snache]]s spawn, delay 2~4 seconds<sup>60f~120f</sup>.
**4 [[Condemned Peng]]s spawn, delay 20~23.33 seconds<sup>600f~700f</sup>.
**3 [[Condemned Peng]]s spawn, delay 13.33~16.67 seconds<sup>400f~500f</sup>.
**5 [[Owlbrow]]s spawn, delay 26.67~33.33 seconds<sup>800f~1,000f</sup>.

==Strategy==
This stage is not difficult with the right units. The Condemned Pengs and Sinner Snaches will act as support for Teacher Bun Bun, and the Owlbrows will act as cash support. The stage begins with 3 Owlbrows, which can be taken out with [[Swimmer Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Fishman Cat]] or [[Hip Hop Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Can Can]] with her Money Up [[Talents|Talent]] unlocked for even more money. When Bun Bun spawns he can consistently be stalled and taken out with Fishman and [[Kotatsu Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Octopus/Sadako Cat]]. Additionally, you can use [[Bishop Cat (Rare Cat)|Sanzo Cat]] to slow Bun Bun and lower his pushing power. After you defeat Bun Bun simply push to the base as the Condemned Pengs won't be able to resist serious attacks on their own.

